{"id":"9791ea877b","t":"The Dawn That Twists Your Neck","c":"ml+io:/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/large_download-193x278.webp","n":69,"l":69,"s":["ml"],"k":{"ml":"the-dawn-that-twists-your-neck"},"u":1795038413010,"desc":"لطالما اعتقدت أنه الحب حتى اللحظة التي اخترق فيها قلبها. وُلدت أميرة لكنها احتُقرت لدماء أمها المستعبَدة، ظنت أن زواجها من ولي العهد سيجلب لها السعادة والاحترام. لكن انتهى الأمر بالخيانة والموت. في كل مرة تموت فيها، تعيد حياتها البدء، محاصَرة في دورة قاسية. لكن في حياتها الرابعة، قررت أن تتوقف عن الهرب. الآن، ستصبح هي الحاكمة بنفسها وتنتقم، ممسكةً بأحدب شفرة يمكنه حتى قطع القدر.","type":"","status":"OnGoing","genres":["رومانسى","شوجو","مانهوا"],"src":{"ml":"the-dawn-that-twists-your-neck"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"the-dawn-that-twists-your-neck|/manga/the-dawn-that-twists-your-neck/1/"},"2":{"ml":"the-dawn-that-twists-your-neck|/manga/the-dawn-that-twists-your-neck/2/"},"3":{"ml":"the-dawn-that-twists-your-neck|/manga/the-dawn-that-twists-your-neck/3/"},"4":{"ml":"the-dawn-that-twists-your-neck|/manga/the-dawn-that-twists-your-neck/4/"},"5":{"ml":"the-dawn-that-twists-your-neck|/manga/the-dawn-that-twists-your-neck/5/"},"6":{"ml":"the-dawn-that-twists-your-neck|/manga/the-dawn-that-twists-your-neck/6/"},"7":{"ml":"the-dawn-that-twists-your-neck|/manga/the-dawn-that-twists-your-neck/7/"},"8":{"ml":"the-dawn-that-twists-your-neck|/manga/the-dawn-that-twists-your-neck/8/"},"9":{"ml":"the-dawn-that-twists-your-neck|/manga/the-dawn-that-twists-your-neck/9/"},"10":{"ml":"the-dawn-that-twists-your-neck|/manga/the-dawn-that-twists-your-neck/10/"},"11":{"ml":"the-dawn-that-twists-your-neck|/manga/the-dawn-that-twists-your-neck/11/"},"12":{"ml":"the-dawn-that-twists-your-neck|/manga/the-dawn-that-twists-your-neck/12/"},"13":{"ml":"the-dawn-that-twists-your-neck|/manga/the-dawn-that-twists-your-neck/13/"},"14":{"ml":"the-dawn-that-twists-your-neck|/manga/the-dawn-that-twists-your-neck/14/"},"15":{"ml":"the-dawn-that-twists-your-neck|/manga/the-dawn-that-twists-you